00:31:01.020 --> 00:31:04.840
<v Meghan Joyce>that the best leaders bring out the best in the people around them.

370
00:31:04.940 --> 00:31:08.080
<v Meghan Joyce>And that really that's what leadership is all about.

371
00:31:08.460 --> 00:31:11.500
<v Meghan Joyce>And it fundamentally changed how I thought about leadership.

372
00:31:11.900 --> 00:31:17.660
<v Meghan Joyce>I think prior to that, as a kid, I thought about leaders as people who were at the center of things.

