00:31:49.560 --> 00:31:53.460
<v Meghan Joyce>And there's no greater place to be as a teammate,

385
00:31:53.460 --> 00:31:56.980
<v Meghan Joyce>but also as just a human.

386
00:31:57.140 --> 00:31:59.960
<v Meghan Joyce>I think to have that confidence building

387
00:31:59.960 --> 00:32:03.000
<v Meghan Joyce>of knowing you can build something really hard

388
00:32:03.000 --> 00:32:04.960
<v Meghan Joyce>and change people's lives as a result.

