402
00:32:50.060 --> 00:33:02.680
<v Meghan Joyce>And I remember chuckling and saying, yeah, when I, too, am a retiring CEO and I have generated a thousand X shareholder return, then I'll find time to sleep well and eat well and spend time with people I love and all that good stuff.

403
00:33:02.860 --> 00:33:14.900
<v Meghan Joyce>And just a few weeks later, I was starting at Uber and I was working probably like similarly very long hours as I was working in my days in private equity, for example.

